  "version": 1,
  "status": "published",
  "description_nl": "2026-11-05: every kind of artifact this portal holds, for ValueStream CC's Clean-up (core/artifacts.py): where it is stored (a store name, * = one file per person or per code), list or one doc per file, which field is its id, author, title, made, last touched, views, who else is on it (shared), the references that must still be there (refs: a parent - orphan - or a part it needs to open - broken), fields it must have (require), purge (errors and notifications: always listed so they can be cleared), and its OWN delete route, pressed as its author or as the Portal Admin (no delete = kept).",
